T</span><span>Place a coinflip bet</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/cash-out-coinflip" class="ref"><span class="m m-post">POST</span><span>Cash out a coinflip table</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/coinflip-presence" class="ref"><span class="m m-post">POST</span><span>Keep a coinflip table open</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/reopen-coinflip" class="ref"><span class="m m-post">POST</span><span>Reopen a coinflip table</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/get-recent-coinflip-rounds" class="ref"><span class="m m-get">GET</span><span>List recent coinflip rounds</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/get-coinflip-terms" class="ref"><span class="m m-get">GET</span><span>Get coinflip terms</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/create-coinflip-order" class="ref"><span class="m m-post">POST</span><span>Create a coinflip table</span></a></li><li><a href="/api-reference/get-coinflip-order" class="ref"><span class="m m-get">GET</span><span>Read a coinflip table</span></a></li></ul></details></li></ul></div><div class="nav-section"><p class="nav-title">Policies</p><ul><li><a href="/compliance-policy" class="">Compliance policy</a></li><li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="">Wallet privacy policy</a></li></ul></div></nav>
